cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Nuclear Spectroscopy Workbench (NSW)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Aravind Loshana A"
version: "0.9.0b1"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-12"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application and Python library for gamma-ray spectroscopy analysis:
  spectrum import, background subtraction, peak search and fitting, energy and
  resolution calibration, with engines for efficiency, activity and nuclide
  candidates validated on synthetic data.
keywords:
  - gamma-ray spectroscopy
  - HPGe
  - peak fitting
  - energy calibration
